cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Migrating BMC IDbases to LOVD"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Snakemake pipeline that migrates the IDbases immunodeficiency
  variant collection from the legacy MUTbase platform into LOVD 3.0,
  standardizing all coordinates to GRCh38 and all variants to HGVS nomenclature.
